      "description": "Shared composer fill and focus-sensitive elevation; mobile rounds only upper corners.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-composer\"><label class=\"ds-composer-label\" for=\"ds-message\">Ask Filmatch</label><textarea class=\"ds-message\" id=\"ds-message\" placeholder=\"Ask about matcha, merienda, or the café...\"></textarea></div>",
      "css": ".ds-composer{padding:1rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid rgb(var(--border-light,202 207 187));border-radius:var(--theme-large-surface-radius,1.5rem) var(--theme-large-surface-radius,1.5rem) 0 0;background:rgb(var(--surface-composer,255 253 247));color:rgb(var(--text-primary,35 43 33));box-shadow:var(--theme-shadow-md,0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / .1),0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / .1));transition:box-shadow 200ms}.ds-composer:focus-within{box-shadow:var(--theme-shadow-lg,0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / .1),0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / .1))}.ds-composer-label{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}.ds-message{font-family:var(--theme-font-family,Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5;display:block;width:100%;min-height:3rem;border:0;resize:vertical;background:transparent;color:inherit}.ds-message::placeholder{color:rgb(var(--text-secondary,80 88 75))}.ds-message:focus-visible{outline:none}@media(min-width:640px){.ds-composer{border-radius:var(--theme-large-surface-radius,1.5rem)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-composer{transition:none}}",
