  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A moment to slow down",
    "overview": "Filmatch's café identity uses warm cream, deep matcha, and charcoal with an unembellished text wordmark. Generous space around a short welcome makes the existing conversation interface feel calm and approachable. Inter is self-hosted; the café identity does not depend on a separate display face, photography, or illustration.\n\nDark mode carries the same hierarchy into deep green neutrals with pale matcha actions. Shared LibreChat primitives retain their keyboard, focus, error, and disabled behavior. The fictional café notice and LibreChat attribution remain readable supporting information.",
